{"v":4,"catch":"勇者拯救世界的故事就要開始了！但我只是一名NPC……","desc":"這又是一個勇者召集夥伴，打敗魔王，拯救世界的故事，但我們的主角不是勇者本人，而是一名普通倒霉的NPC。他踏上旅程的原因也很簡單——因為勇者從他的家裡擅自拿走了錢！為了找到勇者把錢拿回來，我們的旅途開始了。\n\n-反套路的故事設定\n-意想不到的劇情走向\n-雖然是個短小的RPG，但要素齊全\n-雙結局設計，故事如何收尾由你來掌握！","publisher":"indienova","release":"2022-02-24","genres":["角色扮演","冒險"],"players":"單機 1 人","langs":["日文","英文","中文 (簡體字)","中文 (繁體字)"],"pmax":1,"poff":1,"rating":"NONE","size":"Switch 2 0.2GB / Switch 0.2GB","modes":["TV 模式","桌上模式","手提模式"],"shots":["https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/cfb06cf72f2bea379a9f0efe19f5fbfd103125bd50ed693aa734aefbe4277ede.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/ede283a84987a99386363b19891f52d65ff61fc3eab95c94a5f6b5244c8397e4.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/fe76947b385193b9d4020d3eefd41305123c59b9933c68255d2e9d0a25510485.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/11c7205c3e2727c811a645fc9afc1a0398c85f3cd5eed494376d7e51abdd2bf6.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/7922600e7d40323a2bd618f9660bf7dd90cc615c59248073590ccb4c5885e1b7.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/35e059bd249abc0ba25c074269fc6d5d958f1e3ac63de6f4cc2fd42cd933072a.jpg"],"titleId":"0100b2e00f64c000","dlc":[]}